    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110619" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέψᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span> (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέψελος</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				gloss on 
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεψάλυξ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>):—<i>spark, piece of the embers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				668
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				227
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				367a5
			</span></i>:— <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεψάλυξ</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠγος</span>, ὁ, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				126
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				107
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.48.6
			</span></i>: prov. phrases, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπὶς ἐν τῷ
				φεψάλῳ κρεμήσεται,</span> i.e. will be hung in the
			chimney, of things laid by and unused, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				279
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ φεψάλυξ</span> not so much
			as . . , Id.<u>Lys.</u> l. c.</div>
